### docqa 文档模块调试
### 先跑第 0 条「登录」：它会把 token 写进全局变量，下面的请求才能用
### 上传用的样例文件由 scripts/make_test_files.py 生成到 target/testfiles/

@host = http://localhost:8082
@username = j111test
@password = test1234

### 0. 先登录（token 为空就报 unsubstituted variable 'token'，跑这条即可）
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 1. 上传 Word（注意请求体是 multipart，IDEA 里靠 < 文件路径 传文件）
POST {{host}}/api/doc/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.docx"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< D:/JavaProjects/docqa/target/testfiles/sample.docx
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. 上传 PDF
POST {{host}}/api/doc/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< D:/JavaProjects/docqa/target/testfiles/sample.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3. 文档列表（page 从 1 开始，size 最大 50）
### 上传后立刻查是 PENDING/PARSING，等一两秒再查就变 SUCCESS
GET {{host}}/api/doc/list?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 文档详情
GET {{host}}/api/doc/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 预览解析出的纯文本（把 id 改成你自己的文档 id）
GET {{host}}/api/doc/1/text?maxChars=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 不带 token 上传（预期 code=401）
POST {{host}}/api/doc/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< D:/JavaProjects/docqa/target/testfiles/sample.txt
--WebAppBoundary--
